# Gisela, Blade of Goldnight's ruling (CR 616.1): with several replacement and prevention effects on one damage event, the
# player dealt the damage orders them. Bot1's Gisela; Bot2's Furnace of Rath ("deals double that damage ... instead"). Bot2
# Bolts Bot1 twice. The first time Bot1 applies Gisela's prevention first: half of 3 rounded up is 2, the 1 left is doubled,
# and Bot1 is dealt 2. The second time Bot1 lets the Furnace go first: 6, half of which (3) is prevented, and Bot1 is dealt 3
# (CR 616.1f: each effect judged on the damage as the one before left it). Bot1 ends at 15. Bot1's own Bolt at Bot2 meets
# two doublings, the Furnace's and Gisela's (CR 614.5: each applies once): 12, and Bot2 ends at 8.

